#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0231 expect=skipped domain=ADSL
#note "Mixed-group seeding pin: no TR01PG* column at all. TRxxPGy is the ONLY pattern whose capture set equals the union {xx, y}, and it matches nothing, so WildcardExpander step 3 seeds no tuple; the step-5 cross-join drops the partial {xx=01} assignment for not covering the union. Expansion list is empty -> NoMatch -> SKIPPED. Requirements.Variables.All: [TRxxPGy] is independently unsatisfied, so both gates point to a skip."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col TRT01P  type=Char
---
S1 | 001 | DRUGA
S1 | 002 | DRUGB
